Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Did you not hear what Allah\Ncommanded
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:02.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}the messenger to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:04.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Salatu was-salam, that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:10.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}My Salat, my devotion in\NSalah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:16.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}all everything I do in my\Nlife
