Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:24.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}reverence for Allah, and the\Nentirety of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}my existence itself as an\Nindividual,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Lillah, it's for Allah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:32.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}No Caesar, no division\Nbetween Caesar.
