Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:40.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}who told us to be in our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}leaders? Did Allah not say to\Nus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:43.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}in the Quran that
