Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:58.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}In all of that as we obey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:01.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}our leaders,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:03.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}well as we lead us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:04.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}there are instructions in the\NQuran and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:06.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}the Sunnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:09.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}There are instructions in the\NQuran and
